model g13_depth_from_ok
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.2 (issue #29), G13: the twin of g13/depth_from. L §2.3: inside the parentheses of q's from term the depth is 6 brackets + the from term + its own bracket = 8, the limit, so the text loads, and q is acc's balance on 2026-02-01 projected from 2026-01-01: its opening, 5.00 PLN."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input d0: date

input d1: date

place acc: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

ask q: ((((((bal(acc, d1) from (d0)))))))

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  d0 = 2026-01-01
  d1 = 2026-02-01
  opening[acc] = 5.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
